        ecrm:P3_has_note               "A small parasol with a cover of cream silk with a deep, printed paisley band. The lining is pale pink, possibly made from silk jersey. There is a deep cream fringe around the cover edge and outside rosette. The stick is hinged to fold, with a metal sliding stopper to keep it straight while open."@en , "Folding parasol with printed silk cover and turned wood stick; English, 1840-50"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/2e5945f4-b1b5-3588-a815-0b70c27210e3/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/2e5945f4-b1b5-3588-a815-0b70c27210e3/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/2e5945f4-b1b5-3588-a815-0b70c27210e3/dimension/3> ;
